<p class="wp-block-paragraph">From the moment a child is conceived, they are a gift from God, bringing hope, love, and a future filled with promise into the world.&nbsp; For countless children across our Nation, adoption provides the gift of a loving family and nurturing home where they can feel safe, supported, and encouraged to pursue their own unique American Dream.&nbsp; This National Adoption Month, we recognize the parents who devote their lives to protecting our Nation&#8217;s children and youth, and we rededicate ourselves to supporting those still waiting to find the loving homes they deserve.</p>
