					<description><![CDATA[<p>By the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and the laws of the United States of America, including the Federal Property and Administrative Services Act (40 U.S.C. 101 et seq.) and the common law, it is hereby ordered: Section 1.  Purpose and Policy.  In order to protect and serve the American people, [&#8230;]</p>
